{
  "name": "Saint Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have nothing equipped to either of your [Hand Slots]. When you use a skill with a [Hate] cost of 3 or higher, reduce the [Hate] cost of that skill by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<p>(SR2): You gain a +2 bonus to [Accuracy].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A combat style that does not carry weapons or shields, and concentrates on praying without hands. It becomes difficult for the other party to turn hostile toward you.</p>",
